WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.310
<b>Episode Six
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:38.640
No one's driving?

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.120
I'm driving by phone.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.560
Don't worry.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.770
I'm a pro at racing games.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:48.330
Look, they're catching up to us!

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.770
Four pursuers. Black spirits, 
mechanical in nature.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.040
Usually called "mechanical spirits."

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.080
Are they Destroyers?

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:01.930
Sure are.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.770
You can tell from the symbol on them.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.540
They found us so quickly?

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.020
Don't flatter yourself.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.950
They're after me.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:19.040
They found out I was trying 
to hack into their HQ's servers.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.930
They've been on my case for months.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.410
Amazing.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.350
Don't worry.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:25.710
The mechanical spirits 
are all low-ranking spirits.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:29.770
They're that mean-looking 
Destroyer lady's goons.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.360
They're able to act independently 
of their Summoner,

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.320
but I've cut off their wireless signal.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.770
They can't call for backup.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:39.580
They're like battery-powered toys: bottom-
of-the-barrel in combat and intelligence.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:41.470
Watch out!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.270
I thought you said they sucked at combat!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.030
They aren't that dumb, either!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:03.410
How unscientific.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.620
Are they the 2.0 upgraded models?

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.950
We can't let them run us down!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:07.830
Dora!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.680
We'll take them on together!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.600
Claw Wind!

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.000
Damn it!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.460
Too fast! I can't hit them!

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.590
Spirit Sword!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.640
So fast! They evaded it again!

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.310
Let's see you dodge <i>this</i>!

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.560
Die!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.660
Yeah! Got 'em!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.100
Nice working with you.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.520
Don't celebrate so soon!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.100
They're catching up!

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:00.870
Claw Wind Strikes!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.000
Phantom Sword!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.390
Crap! They split up!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.840
This is bad!

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:19.610
Holy Shield!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.660
That's amazing, Ah Jie!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.450
How's it looking? Can you hold it?

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.180
For now, at least...

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.640
At least they don't have any heavy weaponry.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.210
They do now!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:40.660
Ah Jie,

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.000
you okay?!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.770
What do you think?!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:48.680
Heaven above, please, let them 
have no explosive weapons!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.390
Crap!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.330
We're done for!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.880
They missed!

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.520
Good thing their aim sucks!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.080
No!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.600
They weren't aiming at us.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.960
They were aiming at the road ahead!

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:18.660
Dora!

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.520
Got it!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.960
Crystal Wings!

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.640
That was close.

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.770
We're too heavy!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:43.250
Oh, crap!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.120
Wait!

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.350
All right, we surrender! Is that enough?!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.660
Apparently not!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.110
What do we do, Ah Jie?!

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:00.600
Obtaining

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:02.180
Searching for usable transport

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:00.770
Obtained

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:00.890
Obtained

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.740
You did this, didn't you?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:52.680
Sorry, but it's time for me to get serious!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.350
Transformer...

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.880
Roll out!

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.620
First blood!

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.570
You wanna die that badly?

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.180
Double kill!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.270
So now you're gonna run, huh?

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.600
Too late!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.200
Game over.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.140
Beautifully done!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.890
Never expected you to be so cool!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.300
You've seen nothing yet!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.470
Why can I smell gas?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.300
Is it leaking fuel?!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:42.700
Crap.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.140
It's not gonna catch on fire, right?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.450
Damn it...

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.060
It's not gonna blow up, right?

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.970
All those anime have been lying to me!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:00.110
Mechas aren't scientifically 
possible after all!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.120
Are you okay?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.050
Yeah, yeah...

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.370
It's...

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:13.330
It's you!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.970
You're that freak I ran into 
during the club festival!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.680
You got me, Ah Jie.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.040
A cross-dresser!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.460
What a weirdo!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.470
Cross-dressing freak.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:31.310
A Summoner has to keep 
their identity hidden.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.180
My disguise was perfect, right?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.970
Let me get back on track.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:41.110
We—Ah Jie, Dora, and Miaowu—
cordially invite you.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.000
Join us,

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.610
and become our group's eyes.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.640
Well...

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.850
I'll have to think about it.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:09:59.810
I gotta say, though.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:03.120
This materialistic world is too boring.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.310
If I hang out with you guys,

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.810
I bet things are bound to become 
even more interesting.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.100
Perhaps.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.660
Right, what was your name again?

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.010
Stan.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.370
What kind of Stan?

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:20.750
Are you an Ein"stan,"

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.970
or Franken"stan"?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.340
Who cares? Same difference.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.340
Welcome to 15 Qiushui St.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:43.580
This is my home,

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.120
my secret laboratory,

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.600
and also my moving fortress!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.060
This place feels kinda embarrassing.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.930
It reeks of filthy otaku.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.810
Save it. The viewers want 
the plot to actually advance.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.500
All right, remind me.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.470
What's our main objective again?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.580
To gather all the information 
we can on the Destroyers.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:06.750
We'll find them!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.560
And we'll beat them up!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.830
Okay.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.910
Simple and violent.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.140
I like it.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.080
Take a look at this.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.310
I've been using satellites to detect 
the fluctuations in spiritual energy

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.290
on the Earth's surface for a while now.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.620
Here's all the spirit 
phenomena that I recorded.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.930
Limited only to the city's 
surroundings, though.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.290
The green dots mark all the dormant 
summoned spirits that have yet to awaken.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.700
There are that many?

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.640
The red dots represent Destroyer activity.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.830
Looks like they don't show up so often.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.970
This is just the data from a month ago.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.240
Let's progress the timeline.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.540
If we follow the passage of time,

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:53.000
you'll notice that the red dots start to 
swallow up the green dots like crazy.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.350
In other words...

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.660
They started snatching up powers, full blast.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:58.580
That's right.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:03.420
Now let's advance time to the night 
you were raided by the Destroyers.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.020
ct database

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.020
Time Adjusted

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:08.600
Hana's Castle

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:07.610
What do you see?

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:09.700
Huh?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.410
Were there that many summoned 
spirits at Hana's place?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.000
I can't even count them all.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.060
I'm starting to get it.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.840
If the Destroyers' aim was to steal spirits,

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.200
their attack on Hana's castle

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.930
was akin to robbing a bank vault.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:25.870
Correct.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.450
Now, pay attention to the timeline.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:29.710
There's another shocking 
revelation waiting for you.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:33.660
In the past few years, there hasn't been 
much summoning activity in the city.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.700
It was all peaceful here.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:39.920
But ever since March 17th of this year, 
spiritual power started fluctuating all over,

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.370
and the number of spirit awakenings 
and battles escalated.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.350
The Destroyers also became 
more and more active.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:49.770
It was almost like all the sleeping 
summoned spirits were awakened that day.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.700
March 17th...

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.310
Why that day in particular?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.440
If I remember correctly...

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:58.980
that was the day

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.410
I summoned Dora.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.690
I don't believe in coincidences.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.690
Dora.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.060
Who are you, really?

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:14.470
I...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.220
Um...

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.080
Actually, I...

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.930
You don't have to tell me.

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:28.000
If we do some digging where the fights 
took place, we should be able to find...

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.180
even more clues!

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.270
Here we are.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.500
It's hard to believe

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.600
these ruins used to be the castle 
where we had dinner the other day.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.970
Damned Destroyers!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:59.410
No time for a pity party now.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.390
Let's get to work.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.330
Entering recon mode.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.060
Activating sonar pulses.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.410
A-Amazing...

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.570
Found it!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.720
Hana's family's camera spirit.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.330
It's a goner,

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.520
but its memory is still intact.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.750
With this, along with sonar data 
and satellite imagery,

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.250
I can reconstruct the crime scene as it was.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.100
There we go.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:40.950
Is that a hologram?

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.100
It's like science fiction.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.180
The first wave came from the sky.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.950
This stone dude's codename 
in the Destroyers is {Li}"Ruthless."

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.500
From the looks of it,

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.630
he's an earth Summoner.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.620
Take a look behind him.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.120
That's a wormhole.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.720
In other words, a portal.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.450
That was how the stone man 
managed to ambush them from above,

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.750
bypassing the castle's defenses.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.720
A clever tactic.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.520
It's not easy to detect spiritual 
energy fluctuations in wormholes.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.800
I bet you ten bucks that there's a 
dimensional Summoner over there.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:16.000
Stan,

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:17.580
that's amazing.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:20.810
The second attack took place in the garden, 
almost at the same time.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.200
I'm sure this lady left quite
an impression on you guys.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.270
Destroyer codename: "Flame."

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.620
It's her!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.620
That's her!

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:32.120
She's an elemental Summoner, 
and her element is fire.

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.350
Her main forms of attack 
are firearms and explosives.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.260
What a mean woman. Real mean.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.370
As for this guy,

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.020
I'm sure Miaowu knows him well.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.520
Br-Brother!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.060
Brother!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:57.520
He's my brother! I've been looking for him!

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.410
Brother...

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:06.000
I don't know what the Destroyers did to him.

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:09.310
He's like a different person.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:11.370
Assassin number four.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.880
Destroyer codename: "Crow."

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.970
Like Miaowu, he's an animal Summoner.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:19.090
He and his crow minions 
are in charge of recon.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.740
Right, Ah Jie.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.370
This is where you got knocked out.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.140
What happened, anyway?

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:29.440
I got transported to a strange place.

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:32.570
Strange, and yet familiar.

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.350
Like a dream.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.780
What was the dream like?

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.660
It was more of a nightmare.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.130
A nightmare of my mother.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.370
If my hunch is correct,

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.680
you got your mind hijacked.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.990
This guy was a stealthy one.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.560
I can only simulate his afterimage.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.850
Is it some kind of illusionary trick?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.970
The sixth assassin appeared from the shadows

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:13.430
and took Hana down in an instant.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.440
Destroyer codename: "Shadow."

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:20.660
A coldblooded Summoner of illusions.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.930
One strike, and you're out.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:23.770
Damn it!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.310
Most of them attacked Hana's grandpa,

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.970
but it was their seventh 
who landed the killing blow.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.790
He's the Destroyers' boss, 
and not only can he absorb spirits,

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.470
he can suck people's souls out, too.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.850
He's a grim reaper, through and through.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.270
There you have it.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:46.770
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:47.270
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:50.020
The Destroyers' gang of seven 
who took part in the raid.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:47.770
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:48.270
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:48.770
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:49.270
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:51.020
<b>Flame               Crow               Ruthless              Heart                  Dream                 Shadow        Space</b>

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.270
And the objective of their raid...

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:58.300
is hidden deep below this hole.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:05.330
Half the castle and the underground 
chamber disappeared just like that.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.060
Why did they do that?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:10.060
Only one way to find out!

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.350
W-Wait for me!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.780
What a perfect spatial hole!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.580
It's so smooth, it hardly feels man-made...

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.110
Must be the dimensional Summoner's handiwork.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.380
Let's check out the restored scene.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.160
Come on.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.200
Are all of these sealed summoned spirits?

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.810
There's more than I can count.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.280
This is like a spirit museum.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.450
For years,

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.600
Hana's family, as part of the Watchers,

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.580
have collected and sealed 
thousands of summoned spirits,

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.060
secretly locking them away 
deep underneath this castle.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.880
But never did they imagine

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:30.390
that all this here would one day 
be swept away by the Destroyers.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.290
What happened to Brother...

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.790
If it weren't for Hana's grandpa,

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.970
we'd all be dead by now.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.320
Hana's grandfather was the strongest, 
most widely capable Summoner I've ever seen.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:55.560
If it wasn't one against seven that night, 
he could've rewritten history.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.060
There's a fragment here that's 
different to the rocks and rubble.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:05.950
That pattern...

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.580
It looks familiar.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.780
Let me analyze it.

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:16.570
It's a chunk of the stone man's body that 
fell off when Hana's grandpa fought him.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:18.700
What?

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.770
Bingo.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:23.540
The detector's also showing some 
special particles on its surface.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.290
Or should I say, a scent?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.370
Let me see.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.540
It's a flower's fragrance. 
I've come across it before.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.270
Red spider lily, also known as 
the equinox flower.

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.250
They aren't common here.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.540
From what I know,

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:41.700
they only grow in one place 
in the city's surroundings.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:42.910
Let's look it up.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.140
Wait a sec.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:45.850
Found it.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:47.520
That was fast.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.620
The Stone Forest.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.450
It's about 300km from the city.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.220
About five hours ago, a notable spiritual 
energy fluctuation was detected there.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:55.640
In other words?

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:56.950
In other words,

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:00.120
one of the seven Destroyers 
was there after they left.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:01.700
Alone?

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:03.870
Let's think for a moment.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.590
We won't get many chances like this one.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.160
But of course,

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.510
it could also be a trap.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:10.420
Doesn't matter!

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.120
With all of us, it's four against one!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.040
It'll work out!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.000
But...

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:14.950
It's no big deal!

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:17.410
If we can't beat him, we'll just run for it!

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:18.120
That's right.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.330
It's worth a shot.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.080
In that case,

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.750
let's go all in!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.250
We'll bet all our chips on this!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:24.750
Hey!

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.720
Guys, have you really thought it through?

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.000
Are you sure we should go?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.750
We'll be facing a Destroyer.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.580
Even being optimistic, our chances 
of winning are less than 10%.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.310
Without a miracle, we'll die.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.220
Doesn't that make it more fun?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:41.500
What're you afraid of?

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.040
It'll take more than that to kill Dora!{Dora's never been dead!}

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:44.410
It's decided, then!

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.080
All right, all right.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.810
What a bunch of idiots.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:49.810
That said,

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.330
I can't help but feel the same way!

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.890
Yeah!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.180
If we leave now, 
we'll be there before sunrise.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:00.520
Let's go!

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:02.430
We set out at once!

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:21.170
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:26.410
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:34.000
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:39.520
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:44.510
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.510
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:54.500
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:59.550
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:04.550
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:09.510
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:16.960
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:22.110
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
